#. level description
#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "Bill decided to put on his old Halloween costume and go for a ride in the nearby haunted hills."
msgstr "Bill memutuskan untuk memakai kostum Halloweennya dan pergi menunggang di bukit berhantu berhampiran."

#. Tourist bus where people ride in the bus (vehicle description)
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "Bill decided to take a shower and give people a ride while climbing hills! Not suitable for cave levels!"
msgstr "Bill memutuskan untuk mandi dan menumpangkan orang semasa mendaki bukit! Tidak sesuai untuk tahap gua!"

