msgstr "Hati-hati tentera! Anda kini berada di Kem But Bill! Cepat, Cepat!"

#. Formula-1 car like race car description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "High power and aerodynamic ultimate hill climbing vehicle. Upgrade downforce to make this car follow the road like a magnet."
msgstr "Kenderaan pendakian utama aerodinamik dan berkuasa tinggi. Naik taraf kuasa tujah untuk buatkanya menuruti jalan seperti magnet."

#. Front suspension upgrade description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "Higher suspension helps you in uneven terrain and gives you more hopping power."
msgstr "Suspensi lebih tinggi membantu anda pada tanah tidak rata dan memberikan lebih kuasa loncatan."

#. Rear suspension upgrade description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "Higher suspension helps you in uneven terrain and gives you more jumping power."
