#. Cave level description
#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "Take an adventure into the treasure cave. It's hard to approach the bumps without hitting the ceiling. Gasoline is a limited resource in a cave."
msgstr "Mengembaralah ke gua harta karun. Sukar untuk mengatasi bonggol tanpa melanggar siling. Gasolin ialah sumber terhad di gua."

#. Achievement title for driving 1000km with Trophy truck
#: src/common/AchievementManager.cpp
msgid "Terrain Rocket"
msgstr "Roket Tanah"

#. Achievement title for driving 1000km with The Rocket
#: src/common/AchievementManager.cpp
msgid "Test Pilot"
msgstr "Juruterbang Ujian"

#. Achievement title for driving 1000km with Jeep
#: src/common/AchievementManager.cpp
msgid "The Classic"
msgstr "Klasik"

#. Achievement title for driving 1000km with Hovercraft
#: src/common/AchievementManager.cpp
msgid "The Softer Side"
msgstr "Sisi Lebih Lembut"

#: src/common/MenuGarageMain.cpp
msgid "The car slot will be emptied due to fatal error. You can still build a new car on the slot. Proceed?"
msgstr "Ruang kereta akan dikosongkan kerana ralat. Kereta baharu masih boleh dibangunkan di ruang ini. Teruskan?"

#: src/common/MenuGarageMain.cpp
msgid "The car slot will be emptied. You can still build a new car on the slot. Proceed?"
msgstr "Ruang kereta akan dikosongkan. Kereta baharu masih boleh dibangunkan di ruang ini. Teruskan?"

#. Dune buggy description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "The highest class of off-road racing vehicles!"
msgstr "Kelas tertinggi kenderaan lumba litar lasak!"

#. Hippie van vehicle description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "The hippie van has plenty of fuel but suffers from loose tires! These tree huggers have also figured out how to drive around trees."
msgstr "Van hippie mempunyai banyak bahan api tetapi kehausan tayar! Penyendat pokok ini juga telah mengenal pasti cara memandu berhampiran pokok."

#. Junkyard level description
#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "The local junkyard is full of Bill's old vehicles"
msgstr "Medan barang buruk tempatan penuh dengan kenderaan lama Bill."

#. Tractor vehicle description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "The tractor is slow and heavy but has great traction and plenty of torque (and a tendency to roll over in steep terrain). Not recommended for caves."
msgstr "Traktor ini perlahan dan berat tetapi mempunyai cengkaman yang baik dan pelbagai kilasan (dan kecenderungan untuk bergolek pada cerun curam). Tidak disyorkan untuk gua."

#. Forest level description (the user has to drive through the trees in the forest)
#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "The trees arent just for decoration, you'll have to drive through them. Highly upgraded vehicle recommended!"
msgstr "Pokok-pokok ini bukan untuk hiasan sahaja, anda perlu memandu melaluinya. Kenderaan yang dinaik taraf tinggi disyorkan!"

#. Minibike vehicle description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "This agile childhood ride becomes a powerful little beast when fully upgraded."
msgstr "Tunggangan zaman kanak-kanak pantas ini menjadi haiwan kecil berkuasa apabila dinaik taraf sepenuhnya."

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge five"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran lima"

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge four"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran empat"

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge one"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran satu"

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge seven"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran tujuh"

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge six"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran enam"

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge three"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran tiga"

#: src/common/Stage.cpp
msgid "This is challenge two"
msgstr "Ini ialah cabaran dua"

#. Achievement title for unlocking 5 stages
#: src/common/AchievementManager.cpp
msgid "To the Moon and Back"
msgstr "Ke Bulan dan Kembali"

#. Achievement title for driving 1000km with Tank
#: src/common/AchievementManager.cpp
msgid "Top Gun"
msgstr "Anugerah Tertinggi"

#. Dragster description
#: src/common/PlayerCarManager.cpp
msgid "Top fuel dragster! Insanely fast, but be careful, it's not easy to control!"
